  "placementNotes": "All parts share the existing hub axis. The sprocket seats at X=-49.8 (extends toward negative X); the disc seats at X=58.6 (extends toward positive X). The existing hub is preserved byte-for-byte in the portal. Rim dishing, tire section, spoke profiles and fastener seats remain visual estimates. This pass does not establish roadworthiness or manufacturing fit.",
